# Private planning notes and internal documentation. Never committed.
# No trailing slash on these three: in a Conductor worktree they are symlinks back to the main
# checkout, and `docs/` matches a directory but not a symlink to one — so with the slash they
# showed as untracked and `git add -A` would have committed the private notes.
docs
tasks

